        "exact_choice_count": null,
        "notes": "Scheduled intakes April and September each year. Please see the program overview for precise dates. Application processing Applications are accepted during the following periods: Intake Opening (9:00 am) Deadline (11:59 pm) April September 1st* Domestic students: April 1st* International students: February 1st* September January 1st* Domestic students: September 21st* International students: July 2nd* *or next business day Intakes may fill before the deadline. Applications are considered for a specific intake. Entrance requirements Applicants must meet the following entrance requirement and will be accepted on a first-qualified basis as long as space remains: English language proficiency: Category 3 \u2013 English Studies 12 (50%) or equivalent Read more about how to meet BCIT\u2019s entrance requirements International applicants This program is available to international applicants. Study permit: A valid BCIT study permit is required prior to starting the program. Post-graduation Work Permit (PGWP) eligibility : While this program currently meets the eligible field of study requirement (CIP) to apply for a PGWP, this program is not eligible for a PGWP due to other criteria not being met. ( CIPC : 11.0801) Apply to program To submit your application: Include proof of meeting all entrance requirements. Convert all transcripts and supporting documents to PDF files . Have a credit card ready to pay the application fee. Apply Now Learn more about how to apply Go back Overview Next up Costs & Supplies",
